{
  "$schema": "is-preview/v1",
  "tag": "is-breadcrumb",
  "category": "navigation",
  "title": "<is-breadcrumb>",
  "titleHtml": true,
  "description": "Documentación y demos de is-breadcrumb e is-breadcrumb-item de InSoft.",
  "storageKey": "docs-is-breadcrumb",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "<is-breadcrumb>",
      "lede": "Migas de pan accesibles con marcado <code class=\"code\">&lt;nav&gt;</code>,\r\n          ARIA roles y separador automático entre items.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-breadcrumb label=\"Catálogo\">\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item href=\"/\">Catálogo</is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item href=\"/ropa\">Ropa</is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item href=\"/ropa/mujer\">Mujer</is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item href=\"\">Camisetas</is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n          </is-breadcrumb>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span class=\"tag\"><is-breadcrumb</span> <span class=\"attr\">label</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"Catálogo\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"tag\"><is-breadcrumb-item</span> <span class=\"attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"/\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>Catálogo<span class=\"tag\"></is-breadcrumb-item></span>\r\n  <span class=\"tag\"><is-breadcrumb-item</span> <span class=\"attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"/ropa\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>Ropa<span class=\"tag\"></is-breadcrumb-item></span>\r\n  <span class=\"tag\"><is-breadcrumb-item</span> <span class=\"attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"/ropa/mujer\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>Mujer<span class=\"tag\"></is-breadcrumb-item></span>\r\n  <span class=\"tag\"><is-breadcrumb-item</span> <span class=\"attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>Camisetas<span class=\"tag\"></is-breadcrumb-item></span>\r\n<span class=\"tag\"></is-breadcrumb></span>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "spa",
      "title": "SPAs — eventos de click",
      "lede": "Sin <code class=\"code\">href</code>, los items se renderizan como texto sin enlace. Conecta tú los handlers.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-breadcrumb id=\"bcSpa\" label=\"Navegación SPA\">\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item>Inicio</is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item>Productos</is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item>Detalle</is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n          </is-breadcrumb>\r\n          <p id=\"bcLog\">Última navegación: ninguna</p>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "bc.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\r\n  const item = e.target.closest('is-breadcrumb-item');\r\n  if (item) console.log('item click', item.textContent.trim());\r\n});",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "icons",
      "title": "Iconos en items",
      "lede": "Usa el atributo <code class=\"code\">icon</code> o el slot <code class=\"code\">start</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<div class=\"demo-stack\">\r\n          <is-breadcrumb label=\"Inicio\">\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item href=\"/\" icon=\"mdi:home\">Inicio</is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item href=\"/articulos\" icon=\"mdi:newspaper-variant\">Artículos</is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item href=\"\" icon=\"mdi:airplane\">Viajes</is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n          </is-breadcrumb>\r\n\r\n          <is-breadcrumb label=\"App\">\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item href=\"/dashboard\">\r\n              <is-icon slot=\"start\" icon=\"mdi:view-dashboard\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></is-icon>\r\n              Dashboard\r\n            </is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item href=\"/users\">\r\n              <is-icon slot=\"start\" icon=\"mdi:account-group\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></is-icon>\r\n              Usuarios\r\n            </is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item href=\"\">\r\n              <is-icon slot=\"start\" icon=\"mdi:account\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></is-icon>\r\n              Perfil\r\n            </is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n          </is-breadcrumb>\r\n        </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span class=\"tag\"><is-breadcrumb-item</span> <span class=\"attr\">icon</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"mdi:home\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>Inicio<span class=\"tag\"></is-breadcrumb-item></span>\r\n<span class=\"tag\"><is-breadcrumb-item</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"tag\"><is-icon</span> <span class=\"attr\">slot</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"start\"</span> <span class=\"attr\">icon</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"mdi:home\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span><span class=\"tag\"></is-icon></span>\r\n  Inicio\r\n<span class=\"tag\"></is-breadcrumb-item></span>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "separator",
      "title": "Separador custom",
      "lede": "Cambia el slot <code class=\"code\">separator</code> de cada item — o sólo el último que se ignora.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-breadcrumb label=\"Slash\">\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item href=\"/home\">\r\n              <span slot=\"separator\">/</span>\r\n              Inicio\r\n            </is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item href=\"/docs\">\r\n              <span slot=\"separator\">/</span>\r\n              Docs\r\n            </is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n            <is-breadcrumb-item href=\"\">\r\n              <span slot=\"separator\">/</span>\r\n              Guía\r\n            </is-breadcrumb-item>\r\n          </is-breadcrumb>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span class=\"tag\"><is-breadcrumb-item</span> <span class=\"attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"/home\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"tag\"><span</span> <span class=\"attr\">slot</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"separator\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></span>/<span class=\"tag\"></span></span>\r\n  Inicio\r\n<span class=\"tag\"></is-breadcrumb-item></span>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
